    "variations": "- Clockwise Deal and Play: Deal and play proceed clockwise instead of counter-clockwise, with the player to dealer's left taking the 5-trick quota, choosing trumps, and leading to the first trick while the player to dealer's right has the 3-trick quota. - Seventh Card Turned for Trump: Instead of freely announcing a trump suit, the 5-trick player may specify that the seventh card dealt to them (the middle card of the second batch of three) will be turned up and its suit becomes trumps. - Next Batch Highest Card Trump: Some play that the 5-trick player may choose trumps to be the suit of the highest card in the next batch of three cards dealt to them, or a randomly chosen card from the remainder of their hand. - Relaxed Return Suit Requirement: Instead of needing at least two remaining cards in the suit being returned after pulling, some play that a player who steals a card need only..."
