    "setup": "Players: One player only. Algerian is a solitaire (patience) game played by a single player. Deck: Two standard 52-card decks shuffled together (104 cards). Equipment: Standard tabletop or digital interface. Dealing: 1. **Foundations**: 8 slots (initially empty or 4 Aces/4 Kings placed if drawn). 2. **Tableau**: 8 depots with 1 card each. 3. **Reserve**: 6 piles with 4 cards each. 4. **Stock**: Remainder of the 104 cards.",
