    "setup": "Players: 2-4 players. 4-player games are usually partnerships (North-South vs East-West). Deck: 40-card Spanish deck (1-7, 10-12). Note: 10 (Sota), 11 (Caballo), 12 (Rey). Equipment: Standard Spanish deck, pen and paper for 21-point tracking. Dealing: 1. Dealer deals 3 cards to each player face down. 2. 4 cards are dealt face up to the table. 3. Dealing is counter-clockwise.",
