    "name": "Bastard Brag",
    "description": "Bastard Brag is a lively variant of Three-Card Brag that mixes the hand rankings of Brag with the card-swapping mechanics of Commerce. Instead of a purely static hand, players are dealt three cards and share access to a 'Widow' hand on the table. Players...",
