    "variations": "- Belote Coinchée: All cards are dealt at once. Players bid for points (e.g., '100 Spades') instead of simple acceptance. Opponents can 'Coinche' (Double). - Belote Découverte: Open-hand variant for 2 players. 6 cards in hand, 6 face-up on table."
