    "setup": "Players: 1 to 6 players, each playing against the Banker (house or rotating player-banker). Deck: Chinese domino set: 32 tiles arranged in 16 pairs. Each tile has a specific ranking in the Pai Gow system. Equipment: Chinese domino set. Three dice (for determining deal order). Blackjack-sized table with three betting circles per player: main bet (seat number), Bonus bet ('B'), and Tie bet ('T'). Dealing: Tiles are shuffled and stacked. Three dice are rolled to determine dealing order. Each player and the banker receive 4 tiles.",
