    "strategy": "Basic: Learn the standard Pai Gow tile ranking system. Set your hands according to the house way (standard optimal splitting). The side bets are independent decisions â€” the Bonus bet has moderate hit frequency, the Tie bet capitalises on the high push rate. Intermediate: In standard Pai Gow, the house edge is significantly reduced when players take turns banking. However, Bonanza Pai Gow's Bonus and Tie bets have FIXED house edges regardless of who banks â€” making them purely house-advantage bets. Advanced: Optimal main-bet strategy: bank whenever possible (standard Pai Gow advice). Side-bet strategy: the Bonus bet's ~27% hit rate (every 3.7 hands) provides frequent wins with moderate variance. The Tie bet exploits the ~40% push rate but typically has a higher house edge. Calculate expected value for each bet independently. - Tip: The regular bet is optional â€” some players skip it...",
