    "description": "Calculation (also known as Strategy or 'Broken Intervals') is a unique solitaire card game that deviates from standard 'Klondike' mechanics. Unlike most solitaires that build in simple 1-2-3 steps, each of the four foundation piles in Calculation builds at a...",
