    "rules": "Objective: Score points by winning tricks and building Calypsos (complete trump suit sequences). First partnership to reach target score wins. Gameplay: 1. Deal 13 each (4 decks = 208 cards). 2. Each player has personal trump (one suit). 3. Left of dealer leads. 4. Follow suit or trump. 5. Trump beats non-trump. 6. Build Calypsos (complete A-K of your trump) from won tricks. 7. Surplus trump cards in tricks = 10 pts each at game end. 8. 4 deals; first to target wins. Scoring: Complete Calypso = 500 (first) or 250 (subsequent). Tricks = 20 each. Partial Calypso cards = 10 each. - Each player has their own personal trump suit. - Surplus duplicates of trump cards in hand cannot be added to a Calypso â€” only one of each rank needed. - Cards won in tricks that don't contribute to your Calypso are worth 10 pts each at game end. Win condition: Highest score after 4 deals (one full game).",
