    "setup": "Players: 4 in fixed partnerships (partners sit opposite). Variants for 2, 3, or 6. Deck: 108 cards (2Ã—52-card packs + 4 Jokers). Jokers and 2s are wild. Equipment: Two shuffled 52-card decks + 4 jokers. Score sheet. Dealing: 11 cards each (Classic). Remainder is stock. Top card turned face-up to start discard pile (if red 3 or wild, bury and turn another).",
