    "description": "Clobyosh (classic Bela or Klaberjass) is considered by many experts to be the finest two-player card game in existence. It combines the Jass-style trump ranking (J-9 high) with a unique melding phase and a 'Schmeiss' (Throw-in) rule. The game is played...",
