    "strategy": "Basic: Dump dangerous high cards when possible before the final trick. Intermediate: Track which players still hold high ranks to avoid being trapped into winning trick seven. Advanced: Manipulate lead timing so opponents are forced into overtake-or-lowest dilemmas late. - Tip: Holding both very high and very low cards gives better endgame flexibility. - Tip: Late-trick position strongly affects whether a tie-high can be forced onto another player.",
