    "strategy": "Basic: If your hand lacks trumps or high-value doubles, drop out of the hand to avoid the Loo penalty. Intermediate: Taking the Miss is high-risk, high-reward. Use it if your current hand has only one low trump. Advanced: Dealer edge: Always use the swap to gain a trump unless your hand is already perfect (which is rare). - Tip: In a 4-player game, pool distribution is tight; don't stay in without at least two decent trumps. - Tip: The 'Loo' penalty is severe - defensive passing is better than aggressive losing.",
