    "strategy": "Basic: As declarer, use the 3ndcard draw to complete your trump sequences or to 'void' a suit so you can trump in later. Intermediate: Teamwork: Defenders must work together to 'bleed' the declarer's trumps using their long suits. Advanced: The Pagat Ultimo: Keeping the Tarock 1 until the very last trick requires impeccable card counting and timing, as it is easily lost if trumps are led early. - Tip: Keep track of the SkÃ¼s (GstieÃŸ) and the 21; they are the only cards that can beat a high Tarock. - Tip: Remember the reverse ranking in red suitsâ€”it is a common beginner mistake to lose a high red card to a lower number.",
