    "setup": "Players: 2 to 5 players. Deck: 35-card stripped deck. Take a standard 52-card deck and remove: all Kings, all Queens, all Jacks, all 2s, and the Ace of Spades (The Chief). Remaining deck: Ace (except Spades), 3-10 of all suits. Equipment: Deck and chips/stakes for optional scoring variant. Dealing: Dealer (rotates clockwise) shuffles; right-hand player cuts. Dealer distributes 5 or 6 cards to each player (depending on regional variant) in two batches. Cameroon: 6 cards (3, then 3). Niger: 5 cards (3, then 2).",
