    "description": "Five Hundred is a trick-taking game for four players in fixed partnerships, invented in the USA in 1904 and now the national card game of Australia. Players bid 6-10 tricks; the high bidder takes a 3-card kitty, discards 3 cards, declares trump, and attempts...",
