    "overview": "Domino game in the Fives family. All doubles are spinners. Score when layout pip total is a multiple of 5. Play to 61 points. Origin: United States (California and Southwestern US; popularized by Dominic C. Armanino) Players: 2-4 Deck: Double-6 domino set Difficulty: Intermediate Duration: 15-30 minutes",
