    "setup": "Players: One player only. Fortress is a patience (solitaire) game; the entire deck is laid out at the start and the single player moves cards between the tableau columns and the four foundations. Deck: Standard 52-card deck. Equipment: Standard 52-card deck. Dealing: Deal 52 cards face-up into 10 columns: two columns of 6 cards (one on the left, one on the right) and eight columns of 5 cards. Four foundation spaces in the centre for aces.",
