    "history": "Gan Deng Yan emerged in southwest China during the early to mid-2010s, with reported roots in Sichuan and documented play in Yunnan variants. - Early 2010s: Game emerges in Sichuan (Shudi), southwest China; spreads to Yunnan and elsewhere.",
