    "variations": "- Four Player Six-Tile Deal: Each player takes six tiles, leaving four face down; one center tile is exposed to start. - Pass-Only Blocking: When blocked, players pass and keep all tiles in hand instead of discarding dead tiles. - Double-Blank 25 Rule: At scoring, the double blank 0-0 counts 25 only if the player holds no other blank tile."
