    "strategy": "Basic: Prioritize the 'Godori' (3 Birds) and 'Gwang' cards. They offer the fastest points. Intermediate: Go/Stop Calculus: If you have 3 points but your opponent is close to a 'Godori', STOP. Don't risk a 'Go' unless your hand is overwhelming. Advanced: Defensive Discarding: If you have a 'Gwang' in hand but there is no match on the table, holding it prevents opponents from getting the 5 Gwang bonus. However, you risk getting stuck with it if the game ends. - Tip: Always capture the bonus Jokers immediately if possible. - Tip: In 3-player games, don't let the leader 'Go' too many times; sometimes you must win with a small score just to stop them.",
