    "variations": "- Animal theme variants: In some editions vultures are replaced with cats (e.g. Il Gioco dei Gatti) or mice with meerkats (Chinese version). Rules unchanged. - Combined tie prize: When all players tie or all valid bids are cancelled, the prize card stays in the centre and its value is added to the next revealed prize. - Player count: Best with 2; playable with 2 to 5. Each player always has 15 bidding cards; with fewer than 5 players some sets are unused."
