    "setup": "Players: 4 or 6 players. In 6-player games, two players sit out each round as dealers. Deck: Standard 52-card deck. Aces are high, 2s are low. Equipment: Standard cards, Go stones for scoring, lottery sticks for partnership selection Dealing: Two players (the Kubariban) deal the entire deck. Each active player gets 13 cards.",
