    "rules": "Objective: Be the first to meld all cards in hand ('Going Kalooki'). Gameplay: 1. **Opening Requirement**: The first meld(s) played to the table must total **40 or 51 points** (depending on house rules). Once 'open', you can meld any value. 2. **Melds**: Sets (Groups) of 3-4 cards of same rank, or Runs (Sequences) of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit. 3. **Joker Rules**: Wild cards can replace any card. Can be 'stolen' by replacing with the natural card. 4. **Scoring**: Numbered cards (2-10) = Face value. Face cards (J, Q, K) = 10. Ace = 11. Joker = 15 points (or 25 as penalty). Scoring: Winner scores 0. Losers score the total points of cards left in their hand. - First meld must total 40 or 51 points - Sets: 3-4 cards of same rank (duplicates allowed from different decks) - Runs: 3+ consecutive cards of same suit - Jokers are wild and can be stolen by replacing with natural card -...",
