    "setup": "Players: One dealer (Bank) and theoretically unlimited players. Deck: Standard 52-card deck. Shuffled thoroughly and cut. Equipment: Standard 52-card deck. Shuffled thoroughly and cut. Dealing: Bank shuffles and deals one card face-up (House card), then two piles (Andar and Bahar) one card each.",
