    "rules": "Objective: Each partnership aims to win at least three of the five tricks in each hand; the team that does so scores points (typically two unless the stake was raised), and the first team to reach 11 points wins the game. Gameplay: 1. Usually, there is NO obligation to follow suit or rank. 2. **Exception (Trump Lead)**: If the 'Haube' (the principal trump) is led, others MUST play a trump if they have one. Scoring: Win 3 of 5 tricks to score 2 points. Players can raise stakes during play. First to 11 points wins. - The three Criticals (Kritische Karten) are permanent trumps: King of Hearts (Maxl), Seven of Bells (Belli), Seven of Acorns (Spitz) - Forehand chooses the Schlag (rank), dealer chooses the Farbe (suit) - No obligation to follow suit except when the Haube is led - Players can 'offer' to raise the stake during play Win condition: First team to reach 11 points",
