    "setup": "Players: 3 players. One is the 'Declarer' (Solo), playing against the other two (Defenders). Deck: 32 cards: Ace, 10, King, Queen, Jack, 9, 8, 7. Equipment: 32 cards: Ace, 10, King, Queen, Jack, 9, 8, 7. Dealing: Dealer deals 12-10-10 cards or 7-5-5-5-5-5. The declarer gets a 'Talon' (2 cards) to discard.",
