    "setup": "Players: 4 players. Each starts with 5 'Life' points. Deck: 40 cards. Ranking: 3, 2, Ace, King, Knight, Jack, 7, 6, 5, 4. Equipment: 40 cards. Ranking: 3, 2, Ace, King, Knight, Jack, 7, 6, 5, 4. Dealing: Each player is dealt 10 cards. No trump suit.",
