    "rules": "Objective: Win tricks containing the tens (10s). Capturing all four tens scores a 'kot' (decisive victory). Gameplay: Standard trick-taking: must follow suit if possible. Highest card of led suit wins the trick. There are no trumps. Scoring: Points are scored for capturing 10s. A Kot (all four 10s) is the ultimate goal. - Must follow suit if able - No trump suit - Capturing 10s is the primary objective - All four 10s = Kot (decisive victory) - Dealer is from the losing team Win condition: Capture the majority of tens, or achieve a Kot by capturing all four tens.",
