    "variations": "- Bonanza Pai Gow: Casino variant offering side bets on specific tile combinations and bonuses for high-ranking hands. - Commission Play: The house takes a 5% commission on all winning bets placed by players against the bank. - Player Banking: A rule allowing players to take turns acting as the banker, gaining the advantage of winning copy hands."
