    "variations": "- Pöytäpaska: Table shit: 4 face-down + 4 face-up per player. Play hand first, then face-up, then blind face-down. Like Shithead. - Ruotsalainen: Swedish: all cards dealt; no stock. - Two Decks: With 6+ players, use two decks. Four-of-a-kind may not clear (house rule)."
