    "rules": "Objective: Be first to 101 (2p/partnership) or 61 (3-4p). Lowest pip total wins each hand. Gameplay: 1. Draw for lead. 2. Each turn: (a) add tile to either end of train, or (b) draw from boneyard (unless only 2 left), or (c) pass. 3. Doubles played across; not spinners. 4. Hand ends when one dominoes or nobody can play. 5. Score: lowest gets sum of losers' pips minus own total. Tie = no score. Scoring: Lowest pip total wins; scores sum of losers minus own. Tie = no score. - Three options: play, draw, or pass. - Cannot draw when boneyard has only 2 tiles. - Doubles across line; not spinners. - 101 target (2p/partnership); 61 (3-4p). Win condition: First to 101 (2p/partnership) or 61 (3-4p).",
