    "setup": "Players: 4, 6, or 8 in two teams. Sit alternately (or opposite in 6/8). Deck: 3 decks + 6 jokers (6p); 4 decks + 8 jokers (8p). Equipment: Board (4/6/8 sides), 5 pegs per player (or marbles). Dealing: 5 cards each. Remainder face-down.",
