    "setup": "Players: 2-8. Best 2; 4 can play partnership (opposite). Deck: Standard 52 cards. A (low) to K (high). Suits irrelevant. Equipment: 52 cards, cribbage board or paper for score. Dealing: 3 cards each, then play. Repeat until deck exhausted. Once per dealer turn: deal tendido (4 face-up) after a 3-card deal.",
    "rules": "Objective: Reach 61 points first. Score via ronda/rondine, porrazo/counter porrazo/san benito, limpia, cards in place, tendido, and card count. Gameplay: 1. **Ronda/Rondine**: After each 3-card deal, players with pairs announce 'ronda', with trips 'rondine'. After those 3 played, highest scores (K=4/12, Q=3/9, J=2/6, 2-A=1/3). 2. **Capture**: Play a card. Match = capture matched + ascending sequence (A above K). No match = card stays. 3. **Porrazo**: Previous play captured nothing; you play matching card = porrazo (bonus). Next player can counter porrazo with 3rd matching; 4th = san benito (instant win). 4. **Limpia**: Capture all table cards; score by last card rank. 5. **Cards in place**: A/2/3/4 played without capture so table count = card value; score that many. 6. **Tendido**: Dealer deals 4 face-up once; score A-4 in place, pairs/trips/fours. Scoring: Cumulative. Ronda/rondine,...",
    "strategy": "Basic: Announce ronda/rondine. Avoid setting up porrazos. Use cards in place when beneficial. Intermediate: Bluff ronda rank. Time porrazos; risk san benito for counter porrazo. Advanced: Track table composition. Save matching cards for porrazo opportunities. Tendido placement. - Tip: Ronda rank not declared before playâ€”bluff possible. - Tip: Counter porrazo risks san benito if opponent has 4th. - Tip: Limpia and porrazo can combine.",
    "variations": "- Cards in Excess of 26: 2p/2 teams: card score = excess over 26 (half normal). - No Ace Above King: USPCC: sequences end at K; A always low. - No Ronda Declaration: Claim ronda/rondine after play; no pre-announce. - Tendido Last: Tendido = last 4 of deck; dealer has no choice of when."
