    "description": "Preferans (derived from the French 'PrÃ©fÃ©rence') is the quintessential card game of the Russian intelligentsia and one of the most intellectually demanding games in existence. Played by 3 or 4 players with a 32-card deck, it is a bidding-based trick-taking...",
