    "strategy": "Basic: Play legally; try to domino before the hand blocks. Intermediate: There are seven tiles in the sixes suit; five are in the center when the spinner is complete. Watch which arms opponents avoid to infer missing suits. Advanced: Use the fact that when one of the two remaining sixes is played on an arm, that arm is blocked to all but the other six. Use opponent arm choices to read their hands. - Tip: Observe which arms opponents do not play on to deduce which suits they lack. - Tip: Opening spinner exposes most suits on the arms; use this for inference.",
