    "setup": "Players: Two players only. Play is simultaneous with no turns; physical speed and alertness are required to play faster than the opponent. Deck: Standard 52-card deck. Shuffle well and divide the pack equally so each player receives 26 cards; no jokers. Equipment: Standard 52-card deck only. Dealing: Shuffle and divide the deck equally (26 cards each). Each player deals five stock piles in a row: first pile 1 card, second 2, third 3, fourth 4, fifth 5. Deal face down then turn the top card of each pile face up. The remaining 11 cards per player stay face down as the spit cards.",
