    "variations": "- Cutting for a stikkar: Cards are cut before the deal; the cutter may look at the bottom card of the stock. If it is a permanent stikkar, it is exposed and can be exchanged by the holder of the king of that suit before the first trick. - Choosing suits face up: As the dealer chooses suits, the cards turned from the stock are laid face up so everyone can see them. - Play with compulsory beating: Every player must beat the highest card so far played to the trick if possible, unless that card was played by their partner."
