    "rules": "Objective: In the main variant Ottocento, the objective is to score points from card values and declared combinations; the first partnership to reach 800 points wins the rubber. Other variants (e.g. Terziglio, Millone) have their own targets. Gameplay: General mechanics: Must follow suit. Trumps win. Matto is an Excuse. High trumps (Angel, World, BÃ©gato) and Moors (1-4) have special status. Scoring: Standard tarot values (Kings/Tarocchi=5, etc.). - Use Tarocchi Bolognesi Ottocento for specific rules Win condition: See Ottocento or Terziglio rules.",
