    "rules": "Objective: Win the pot by having the best three-card hand or by being the last player remaining after all others have folded. Gameplay: 1. Ante/Boot Phase All players place the agreed minimum stake (boot) into the pot This ensures there is something to play for in each hand Scoring: Win the pot by having the best three-card hand or by being the last player remaining after all others have folded. - Blind Player: Has not looked at their cards - Must bet at least the current stake (minimum) or up to twice the current stake (maximum) - Can bet less than a seen player - Seen Player: Has looked at their cards - Must bet at least twice the current stake (minimum) or up to four times the current stake (maximum) - Must bet double what a blind player bets Win condition: Win the pot by having the best three-card hand or by being the last player remaining after all others have folded.",
