    "history": "One of the oldest European card games, dating back to the 15th century (Trentuno). - 15th century: Trentuno and related 31 games attested in Europe; spread to France, England, Ireland and popular in Greece. Remains largely unchanged. Popular in Greece as a casual social game. Often played in cafes or social gatherings in Greece.",
