    "rules": "Objective: Get a hand totaling 31 points in one suit, or have a higher score than the lowest player. Gameplay: Turn: Draw one card from Stock or Discard pile, then discard one card. Try to improve suit sum. Knocking: If a player thinks they have high enough score, they knock. Everyone else gets one last turn. Scoring: A=11, K/Q/J=10, Num=Face. 3 of a kind (30pts) is a special rule in some variants. Scoring: Lowest score loses a life. If doing 31 exactly (Blitz), round ends immediately and everyone else loses a life. - Suits matters (points must be same suit) - Ace = 11 - Knocking ends the round (after 1 orbit) - 31 is instant win Win condition: Get a hand totaling 31 points in one suit, or have a higher score than the lowest player.",
