    "history": "Country/Region of Origin: Europe Time Period: Early 1900s Historical Development: The game evolved from traditional card games in the region Cultural Significance: Popular social and family game - Early 1900s: Game first documented - Mid 1900s: Spread to other regions - Modern Era: Continues to be played worldwide - Online Presence: Digital versions available",
