    "rules": "Objective: Empty hand (Tong Its) or have lowest points when Draw is called/deck runs out. Gameplay: 1. Draw (from Stock or Discard if meldable). 2. Meld (Bahay) optional. 3. Sapaw (Lay off) on others' melds. 4. Discard. Winning: 'Tong Its' (0 cards). 'Draw' (Call comparison). Stack run out. Scoring: Winner gets paid by losers based on points or fixed stake. Burned (Sunog) if no meld laid. - Sapaw (laying off) is key - Cannot call Draw if Sapawed recently - Burned (Sunog) if no melds open Win condition: Empty hand (Tong Its) or have lowest points when Draw is called/deck runs out.",
    "strategy": "Basic: Meld early to avoid burning. Dump high cards. Intermediate: Hold cards to Sapaw opponents (preventing them from calling Draw). Call Draw when you have low points and opponents are likely heavy. Advanced: Card counting. Bluffing strength by not melding. - Tip: Don't delay opening. - Tip: Watch the 'Draw' conditions.",
