    "rules": "Objective: Win exactly the number of tricks bid. Highest total score wins. Gameplay: Bid by placing card face-down (rank = trick bid, court = 0). Highest bid selects trump (their card's suit). Play tricks. Follow suit. Trumps played face-down (hidden). Can't lead trump unless only trumps remain. Scoring: Exact bid = positive. Over/Under = negative (difference). - Card-as-bid mechanic - Trumps played face down - Re-deal for all-number or all-court hands - Can't lead trump until trumped Win condition: Win exactly the number of tricks bid. Highest total score wins.",
