    "rules": "Objective: Score points by winning tricks and making contracts; first partnership to reach 500 points below the line wins the game. Gameplay: Bidding: 1-7 (tricks over 6). Denominations: ♠<♣<♦<♥<NT. 3 consecutive passes end auction. Declarer plays against defenders. NO dummy. Follow suit. Both sides score below-the-line for tricks. Honors, slams, undertricks scored above-the-line. Scoring: Below line: tricks × contract value. Above line: honors, slams, penalties. Both sides score for tricks. First to 500. - No dummy - Both sides score below-the-line - Bidding escalation (screw) - Honors bonuses - Slam bonuses Win condition: First team to 500 points.",
